      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あなたたちだって\r\nポーションだとかフェニックスの尾だとか\r\nいろいろ使うでしょう？",
        "official_en": "Oh that’s rich coming from you lot! I know you use potions and phoenix downs, and the like, too!",
        "real_en": "You use potions, Phoenix Downs, and all sorts of other things too, don't you?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
