        "official_en_sha256": "1de56726bb105cdfa9f05ea66be02161b36ed31d0981e1b7d0d8aa616916a915"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "おやおや……思ったよりやるようじゃないですか。\r\nですが、残念でした。\r\n蘇生薬をポイっと！",
        "official_en": "Oho... It appears you meddling maggots are tougher than you look.\r\nBut, unfortunately for you...\r\nI’ve got a reviving potion! Ploink!",
        "real_en": "Oh? You're better than I expected.\r\nBut what a shame.\r\nHere goes a reviving potion!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
