      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "さて、私はおいとまさせていただきます。\r\n実験体ども！　時間を稼いでおきなさい！",
        "official_en": "Well, time for me to skedaddle. Minions! Keep them busy!",
        "real_en": "Well then, I'll be taking my leave. Experimental subjects! Keep them occupied!"
      },
